@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Terms & Conditions"; }
<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="surface p-4 p-lg-5">
        <div class="eyebrow">TBA Datalytics Online Learning</div>
        <h1 class="h2 fw-bold mt-2">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-muted-custom">Last updated: October 3, 2026</p>
        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">1. Using the platform</h2>
        <p>You must provide accurate registration information and keep your account credentials secure. Accounts are personal and must not be shared.</p>
        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">2. Course enrolment and payment</h2>
        <p>Enrolment gives you access to the learning experience. Paid courses require confirmed payment before graded assessments and certificate eligibility are unlocked. An order created in the platform is not, by itself, proof of settlement.</p>
        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">3. Assessments and academic integrity</h2>
        <p>Learners must complete assessments honestly. Sharing answers, impersonating another learner, submitting another person's work, or manipulating assessment requests may result in suspension or invalidation of results.</p>
        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">4. Capstone projects</h2>
        <p>Where a course requires a capstone, the learner must submit an original project that meets the course requirements. An instructor or authorised reviewer may request revisions before approval.</p>
        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">5. Certificates</h2>
        <p>Certificates are issued only after the applicable payment, module, assessment, and capstone requirements have been satisfied. TBA Datalytics may verify certificate authenticity using the certificate verification service.</p>
        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">6. Learning materials</h2>
        <p>Course content and platform materials may be protected by intellectual-property rights. You may use them for your personal learning but may not redistribute paid or restricted materials without permission.</p>
        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">7. Changes and availability</h2>
        <p>We may improve courses, assessments, platform features, or policies. Reasonable efforts will be made to preserve learner progress during changes.</p>
        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>For account, payment, course, or certificate questions, contact TBA Datalytics through the support channel published by the platform.</p>
    </div>
</div>
